  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/2b93c006-1332-4940-9ca2-1eec379216f4.png\" style=\"width:2.8in;height:1.31319in\" /><br />Equation of the tangent is<br /><math><mi>Y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Using section formula, we get,<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />i.e. <math><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
